From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP collision keeps the owned floor

A radius-4 ownership miss treats a kept chunk as foreign once the
halo touches the carved corridor. The stand-in box does not stop a
fall when the entity is already inside it, so villagers dropped
through pads this thread owned. The corridor stays empty. Owned
chunks keep their blocks. A heightmap above minY is not a floor.
Not a new splitter. Post-applyAllPatches.
